crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=260ca8994976bf38cb88df01fd7bce53, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77fcc7fec4706f641bc6e6bafe88f3a6 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3378d3b13f6db5f7ea10316be5632a66 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "徒然草より、\n\n「静かに思へば、よろづ過ぎにしかたの恋しさのみぞ、せむかたなき。\n人静まりて後、永き夜のすさびに、何となき具足とりしたため、殘し置かじと思ふ反古など破りすつる中に、亡き人の手習ひ、絵かきすさびたる見出でたるこそ、ただその折の心地すれ。\n\nこのごろある人の文だに、久しくなりて、いかなる折り、いつの年なりけむと思ふは、あはれなるぞかし。手なれし具足なども、心もなくてかはらず久しき、いと悲し。」\n\nをお願いします。\n読み方はお任せします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sumomo__15/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=260ca8994976bf38cb88df01fd7bce53", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=260ca8994976bf38cb88df01fd7bce53, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77fcc7fec4706f641bc6e6bafe88f3a6 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3378d3b13f6db5f7ea10316be5632a66 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "もしかして、ナンパですか？\nいい年して　すももみたいな、フワフワロリ－タがすきなの？\n\nしょうがないにゃぁ。\nいい年して　すももみたいなフワッフワロリータが好きなロリコンさんに\nエールを送ってあげる！\n\nロリコォォォォン、ファイオッ！ファイオッ！ファイオッ！\n\n元気良くっ！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sumomo__15/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0108d5d5055c2822a20012de2440cb6e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0108d5d5055c2822a20012de2440cb6e, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0f3aa02f66606a50f5edba68d9138fb7 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3101245a113d1b973ecf6a17ef48a715 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sumomo__15/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=260ca8994976bf38cb88df01fd7bce53", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1975028050418110464%2FWCcg3DUF.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=260ca8994976bf38cb88df01fd7bce53, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/http